# Without the exact-membership skip, a replay after a lost flip response
# recomputes its key set from the already-flipped membership and resubmits it
# under the original saga identity.
MODULE: NoIdentityConflictReplaysInstalled
TARGET: NoIdentityConflict
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a replay resubmits an already-installed membership under the original id with a changed key set
PERTURBS: Flip

--- FIND
          /\ IF Superseded(e) \/ old = new
--- REPLACE
          /\ IF Superseded(e)
--- END
